    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome To Silky Road</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and defend your train against waves of enemies, survive epic bosses, and discover the secrets of the Silk Road.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Defend Your Train</strong>  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Silk Road is dangerous. At every station, waves of enemies will close in on your train. Use your weapons, cart abilities, and quick reflexes to keep it safe and moving forward.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870990/extras/1aaf96f5fcfc561f14f3c71047eba904.poster.avif?t=1755778050\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870990/extras/1aaf96f5fcfc561f14f3c71047eba904.webm?t=1755778050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870990/extras/1aaf96f5fcfc561f14f3c71047eba904.mp4?t=1755778050\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Your Train</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before setting off, design your train from a variety of carts. Each one changes how you play, offering new tactics and combinations. Experiment with different layouts to be ready for whatever the Silky Road throws at you.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870990/extras/76ed4b6ff81c99632b3468f509475cab.poster.avif?t=1755778050\" width=780 height=263 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870990/extras/76ed4b6ff81c99632b3468f509475cab.webm?t=1755778050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Boss Fights and Big Guns</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face powerful bosses, adapt to their attacks, and survive each encounter to claim victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870990/extras/954381878b3aef0e621bf10f334ba8d9.poster.avif?t=1755778050\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870990/extras/954381878b3aef0e621bf10f334ba8d9.webm?t=1755778050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870990/extras/954381878b3aef0e621bf10f334ba8d9.mp4?t=1755778050\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unexpected Events</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run brings surprises , meet merchants, odd characters, or strange events. Your choices can shape your path or change your fate. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870990/extras/3463574fe898ef810b584cf351b4ff69.poster.avif?t=1755778050\" width=612 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870990/extras/3463574fe898ef810b584cf351b4ff69.webm?t=1755778050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870990/extras/3463574fe898ef810b584cf351b4ff69.mp4?t=1755778050\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Can You Reach the End of the Road?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run pushes deeper into the unknown. Defeat zone bosses, unlock new biomes, and build a train worthy of legend.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you make it back? Will you reach the end of the line?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlist <strong>Silky Road</strong> now and hop aboard.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome To Silky Road</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and defend your train against waves of enemies, survive epic bosses, and discover the secrets of the Silk Road.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Defend Your Train</strong>  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Silk Road is dangerous. At every station, waves of enemies will close in on your train. Use your weapons, cart abilities, and quick reflexes to keep it safe and moving forward.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870990/extras/1aaf96f5fcfc561f14f3c71047eba904.poster.avif?t=1755778050\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870990/extras/1aaf96f5fcfc561f14f3c71047eba904.webm?t=1755778050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870990/extras/1aaf96f5fcfc561f14f3c71047eba904.mp4?t=1755778050\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Your Train</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before setting off, design your train from a variety of carts. Each one changes how you play, offering new tactics and combinations. Experiment with different layouts to be ready for whatever the Silky Road throws at you.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870990/extras/76ed4b6ff81c99632b3468f509475cab.poster.avif?t=1755778050\" width=780 height=263 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870990/extras/76ed4b6ff81c99632b3468f509475cab.webm?t=1755778050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Boss Fights and Big Guns</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face powerful bosses, adapt to their attacks, and survive each encounter to claim victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870990/extras/954381878b3aef0e621bf10f334ba8d9.poster.avif?t=1755778050\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870990/extras/954381878b3aef0e621bf10f334ba8d9.webm?t=1755778050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870990/extras/954381878b3aef0e621bf10f334ba8d9.mp4?t=1755778050\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unexpected Events</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run brings surprises , meet merchants, odd characters, or strange events. Your choices can shape your path or change your fate. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870990/extras/3463574fe898ef810b584cf351b4ff69.poster.avif?t=1755778050\" width=612 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870990/extras/3463574fe898ef810b584cf351b4ff69.webm?t=1755778050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870990/extras/3463574fe898ef810b584cf351b4ff69.mp4?t=1755778050\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Can You Reach the End of the Road?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run pushes deeper into the unknown. Defeat zone bosses, unlock new biomes, and build a train worthy of legend.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you make it back? Will you reach the end of the line?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlist <strong>Silky Road</strong> now and hop aboard.</p>",
    "short_description": "Silky Road is a roguelike top-down shooter where you build a train from unique carts and defend it against waves of enemies. Loot, upgrade, and push forward, one station at a time, to reach the end of the Silk Road and uncover its secrets.",
